! The one-atom primitive cell of `al2-metal.in`, on the 4x4x4 unshifted grid that
! cell's 4x4x2 unfolds to, with no symmetry: the phonon at q = (0, 0, 1/2) crystal
! (half of b3) folds onto `al2-metal.in`'s Gamma, whose modes `ph.x` has computed
! (reference.out.ph-al2-metal), so the metallic q != 0 route is checked against a
! zone-centre calculation it shares no machinery with.
 &control
    calculation='scf'
 /
 &system
    ibrav=2, celldm(1)=7.50,
    nat=1, ntyp=1,
    ecutwfc=15.0, nosym=.true., noinv=.true.,
    occupations='smearing', smearing='marzari-vanderbilt', degauss=0.05
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-12
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Al  26.98 Al.pz-vbc.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS (alat)
 Al  0.00  0.00  0.00
K_POINTS automatic
 4 4 4 0 0 0
